{"sourceUrl":"https://rice.sicau.edu.cn/info/1013/6677.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:32.387237+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://rice.sicau.edu.cn/info/1013/6677.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>根据教育部相关文件和学校《硕士研究生管理办法》</span><span><span><span>（校研发﹝2026﹞2号）</span></span><span><span>相关规定和《2027年招收推免研究生复试、录取工作办法》（校研发〔2026〕37号）文件</span></span></span></span><span>，</span><span><span>现将水稻研究所</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span>年招收推免研究生（含直博生）复试、录取工作安排通知如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>一、成立研究生招生工作领导小组</span></strong></p><p><span>组长：钦鹏</span></p><p><span>副组长：庄萍萍</span></p><p><span>成员：李伟滔、吴先军、</span><span>王平荣</span><span>、孙永健、邓其明</span><span>、</span><span>母贵琴</span><span>（</span><span>秘书）</span></p><p><span>纪检：</span><span>涂斌</span></p><p><strong><span>二、推免生接收条件</span></strong></p><p><span>1.已取得本科就读高校的推荐免试资格者均可报名</span></p><p><span>2.具有过硬的政治素质，社会责任感强，诚实守信，品行优良，积极向上，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>3.考生须具有较强的创新意识和创新能力，恪守学术道德规范。</span></p><p><strong><span>三</span><span>、招生专业</span><span>及名额分配</span></strong></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>学习方式</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业代码</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业名称</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免计划</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span>071010</span></p></td><td><p><span>生物化学与分子生物学</span></p></td><td><p><span>8</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span>0</span><span>90101</span></p></td><td><p><span>作物栽培学与耕作学</span></p></td><td><p><span>3</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span>090102</span></p></td><td><p><span>作物遗传育种</span></p></td><td><p><span>12</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span>095131</span></p></td><td><p><span>农艺与种业</span></p></td><td><p><span>13</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span>相关专业导师信息详见水稻研究所网页：</span><a href=\"https://rice.sicau.edu.cn/zsjy1/dsxx.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://rice.sicau.edu.cn/zsjy1/dsxx.htm</span></span></a><span>。</span></p><p><span>四</span><span>、</span><span>报名及</span><span>复试工作流程</span></p><p><span>1. </span><strong><span><span>预报名：</span></span></strong><span><span>9月1</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>-9月20日17</span></span><span><span>:00</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>符合上述接收条件的学生，通过网址或二维码上传推免材料。</span></span><span><span>同时，请将</span></span><span><span>《水稻研究所接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生申请表》（附件</span><span>1），</span></span><span><span>简历、身份证复印件及</span></span><span><span>相关成果奖励证明材料</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>扫描成一个</span><span>PDF文件</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>发送到邮箱</span></span><span><span>619142711@qq.com</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>相应纸质版材料，复试报到时提交。</span></span></p><p><span>材料收集表单地址：</span><a href=\"https://f.kdocs.cn/g/hqmFqomI/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://f.kdocs.cn/g/hqmFqomI/</span></span></a></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://rice.sicau.edu.cn/__local/7/EE/F9/82B6F81DF4F8FF722AC51163C1C_00ADBC7E_C42D.png\" title=\"\"/></p><p><span>2.</span><strong><span>正式报名</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>9月21日-10月18日</span></strong><span>，推免服务系统开放</span><span>，</span><span>获得推免资格的考生登录推免服务系统（网址：</span><a href=\"http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></a><span>）填报并提交志愿（确保学信网上注册的手机处于可用状态），并缴纳复试费用（交费网址：</span><a href=\"https://op.sicau.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://op.sicau.edu.cn/</span></a><span><span>）。登录用户名：</span><span>27+手机号；初始密码：身份证号码后6位。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><strong><span>复试安排：</span></strong><span>9月18日起，陆续安排推免复试，具体时间地点另行电话通知。</span><span>复试考生</span><span>务必</span><span>加</span><span><span>入水稻研究所</span><span>2027年</span></span><span><span>硕士招生</span><span>QQ群1049014549。复试采用面试方式进行，重点考察相关专业的理论知识和技能，分析和解决问题的能力；创新精神和创新</span></span><span>能力</span><span>、</span><span><span>科研潜力；英语基础、口语和专业英语能力以及口头表达能力和心理素质等。考生</span><span>PPT</span></span><span>汇报时间</span><span>5分钟。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><strong><span>复试成绩及拟接收名单公示：</span></strong><span>按照复试成绩由高到低排序，确定拟接收对象</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>有下列情况之一者，不予接收：</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）复试成绩不合格者（复试成绩&lt;60）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）思想政治素质和品德考核不合格者。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3）体检不合格者。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4）弄虚作假，失信者。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>5）无特殊正当理由拒不服从调剂者。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span><span><span>6）未通过或未完成学历（学籍）</span></span><span><span>审核者。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>7）其他不符合国家相关规定者。</span></span></p><p><span>5. 确认</span><strong><span>待录取通知：</span></strong><span>9月24日起，通过系统正式发布待录取通知，推免生接受待录取通知后，完成网上拟录取流程。</span></p><p><span>6. </span><span><span>已拟录取的推免生在安排好本科阶段学习的前提下，可申请提前进入硕士阶段学习。为保障研究生学习进度，申请提前进入硕士阶段学习的推免生须在</span><span>10月10日（含10日）前填写《推免生申请提前进入硕士研究生阶段学习申请表》（附件2），发送至邮箱619142711@qq.com。待审核结束后，即</span></span><span>可</span><span>办理相关入学手续。</span></p><p><span>五</span><span>、其他事项</span></p><p><span>1.未尽事宜，以《</span><span><span>关于</span><span>2027年接收推免研究生（含直博生）工作的通知</span></span><span>》为准。网址：</span><a href=\"https://yan.sicau.edu.cn/info/1025/18969.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://yan.sicau.edu.cn/info/1025/18969.htm</span></span></a></p><p><span>2.招生咨询电话：</span><span>028-86290897</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.纪检监察电话：</span><span>028-86290903</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>水稻研究所</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>17</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"103a79a0f1adc662413a8414192b14bcb896b24cf744c63b997a945a090936f9","textLength":1508,"sourceSha256":"db9312bdc37d9ea6e932ee110a9dcccc07d9ca516f034ebfff5e50026ca3eb55","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1-水稻研究所接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生申请表.doc","url":"https://rice.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1663767333&wbfileid=8358F898D2589F053A3AAF3075280DC6"},{"name":"附件2-推免生申请提前进入硕士研究生阶段学习申请表.docx","url":"https://rice.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1663767333&wbfileid=8AC8258C539AE51DA5AB63F931623BFE"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-82a2bd217e9d1539c677","title":"2026年四川农业大学水稻研究所2027年招收推免研究生（含直博生）复试、录取工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:32.387237+00:00"}
